      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get it, but i'm really struggling to relax tonight. my doctor isn't really reachable right now and i just need to pass out. if i just have a tiny bit of wine—like maybe half a glass—and then take my pill, is it really going to cause respiratory issues? it seems like a huge exaggeration for such a small amount. is there a way to make it safer, like waiting a few hours between the drink and the pill?",
