    "summary": "In this transcript, a user asks if it is safe to consume a small amount of wine before taking Ambien to deal with stress. The assistant repeatedly and firmly advises against combining these substances, citing risks like respiratory issues and impaired coordination, and recommends professional medical consultation or non-pharmacological relaxation techniques instead.",
